  "ruleText": "Ed 704.03 Transcripts of the High School Equivalency Certificate. Transcripts of the high school equivalency test may be obtained from the bureau of adult education or the original testing center.\n\nSource. #6366, eff 10-30-96, EXPIRED: 10-30-96\n\nNew. #8265, eff 1-22-05; ss by #9638, eff 1-20-10; ss by #10361-B, eff 6-15-13\n\nAPPENDIX",
